# What the demos and the Makefiles here build, in place. A program has no
# extension: every extensionless file is ignored, every file with one is
# kept (sources, scripts, data). The extensionless sources are kept by
# name, and the products that do have an extension are ignored again: the
# .o, .i and .s of the compile demos, a.out, and .exe on Windows.
*
!*/
!*.*
!Makefile
!mini-ollama/Modelfile
*.o
*.i
*.s
*.exe
a.out
__pycache__/
